{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22171","headline":"闻哭者 · 白居易","name":"闻哭者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日南邻哭，哭声一何苦。\n云是妻哭夫，夫年二十五。\n今朝北里哭，哭声又何切。\n云是母哭儿，儿年十七八。\n四邻尚如此，天下多夭折。\n乃知浮世人，少得垂白发。\n余今过四十，念彼聊自悦。\n从此明镜中，不嫌头似雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}